====== Sercomm NA502 ======

The [[toh:sercomm:start|Sercomm]] NA502 is a ZigBee/Z-Wave gateway sold under various brands (e.g. A1 Smart Home Gateway in Austria). It is based on the MediaTek MT7621 SoC with a Gigabit Ethernet port. 

